Both required symbolic proofs now close with `#Top`: the generalized loop invariant against the base definition, and the arbitrary-integer entry-point theorem against the independently proved summary. I’m packaging those exact successful commands into `prove.sh`, then I’ll run the script end-to-end and audit hashes/artifacts.
